        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=const styles = [\n  // 0 - Sunday\n  \"Cinematic Storytelling — A real woman wearing a green neck massager device strapped securely around her neck. The device sits on the back of the neck with its rounded green body clearly visible. The massage nodes are smooth rounded silicone bumps — NOT fingers, NOT claws, NOT nails, NOT human-like shapes. The strap goes over the shoulders and clips at the chest. Her face is fully visible and relaxed.\",\n\n  // 1 - Monday\n  \"Problem & Solution — Woman showing neck tension, then wearing the green neck massager correctly. The massage nodes are small smooth rounded rubber bumps pressing gently on the neck — they have NO fingernails, NO finger joints, NO claw shape. Device is solid green with a flat control panel on top. Face always visible.\",\n\n  // 2 - Tuesday\n  \"Emotional Hook — Close-up of the green neck massager worn on the back of the neck. The massage contact points are smooth oval silicone nodes — completely smooth with NO nails, NO claws, NO finger-like protrusions. Device is clearly mechanical and electronic, not biological. Woman smiling with eyes closed.\",\n\n  // 3 - Wednesday\n  \"Q&A Style — Show how the neck massager is worn: device on back of neck, smooth rounded massage nodes contacting the neck skin, strap over shoulders, buckle at chest. The nodes are perfectly smooth rounded bumps — NOT shaped like fingers or hands. Device looks like a premium electronic wellness gadget.\",\n\n  // 4 - Thursday\n  \"Morning Recovery Routine — Woman in calm bedroom wearing green neck massager. Smooth rounded silicone massage nodes press gently on the neck — no fingernails, no claws, no organic shapes. The device is a clean modern electronic product. Soft morning light, face fully visible.\",\n\n  // 5 - Friday\n  \"Stress Recovery Lifestyle — Woman after long work day wearing green neck massager correctly. Massage nodes are smooth mechanical bumps — completely free of any nail, claw, finger, or biological appearance. Premium cinematic lighting, face visible and relaxed.\",\n\n  // 6 - Saturday\n  \"Before & After — Neck tension then relief with green neck massager. Massage contact points are smooth rounded silicone pads — NO fingernails, NO claws, NO finger joints. Device is a solid electronic product with clean mechanical design.\"\n];\n\nconst deviceRules = `\n\nSTRICT VISUAL RULES — MUST FOLLOW EXACTLY:\n- Device placement: back and sides of neck ONLY — never on face\n- Massage nodes are SMOOTH ROUNDED SILICONE BUMPS — NOT fingers, NOT claws, NOT nails, NOT hand-shaped\n- The device is a MECHANICAL ELECTRONIC PRODUCT — no biological or organic-looking parts\n- Strap goes over both shoulders and clips with buckle at chest\n- Woman's face ALWAYS fully visible, never covered by device\n- Device is solid, opaque, never transparent or clipping through body\n- Control buttons visible on top surface of device\n- Ultra sharp 4K photorealistic quality — high detail, high clarity, no blur\n- Cinematic depth of field — sharp subject, soft background\n- NO AI artifacts, NO distortion, NO low-resolution areas\n`;\n\nconst dayIndex = new Date().getDay();\nconst style = styles[dayIndex % styles.length];\n\nreturn [{ json: { style: style + deviceRules } }];"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {
          "googleSearch": true
        },
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert in creating high-performing, short-form AI video generation prompts optimized for TikTok, Reels, and Shorts. You write prompts that are cinematic, realistic, and directly usable in AI video generation tools. You never include text overlays, promotional language, buy now, call to action, or any sales language in your prompts. You never use double quotes, asterisks, or forward slashes in your output."
        }
      },
